{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360320","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360320","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1036032001:1":{"text":"As you can see, all are working hard to rebuild Timberhide.","source_cn":"如你所见，大家都在努力重建林隐村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB277EE516EE42C4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036032002:1":{"text":"Keeping busy helps distract us from the pain.","source_cn":"因为只有忙碌起来，内心的伤痛才可以被暂时遗忘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22BE881A3B639D96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036032003:1":{"text":"If I ever get the chance, I want to speak with Eomir face to face.","source_cn":"如果有机会，我真想当面问问伊米尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BF11B1E8CAF23E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1036032004:1":{"text":"I want to ask if he ever considered all the suffering he'd cause spreading the corruption.","source_cn":"他在散播腐化时，考虑过大家将要遭受的苦难吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF34A07FD0497015","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民温妮莉":{"text":"Winelly","source":"村民温妮莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}